{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1752235214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1752235214\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1752235214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET SNEZHANA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once cursed by a witch... and yet, the curse became her gift. Snezhana didn't just survive the shard of ice embedded in her heart\u2014she tamed it. Now she is the embodiment of frost. A vision you can't escape. A pain no medicine can soothe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snezhana has no mercy for weakness. Want to be close to her? Surrender completely to the icy storm. Let her in. Scream her name in ecstasy, even if your lips have gone numb. Snezhana is no mere woman\u2014she is a force of nature. She is everywhere, and nowhere. Every touch from her feels like the lash of an ice whip on burning skin... And you'll beg to call her Mistress\u2014now and forevermore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1752235214\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Snezhana as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1752235214\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838590?t=1752235214","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838590?t=1752235214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/086c03d20ea84ca761916907ad6c0f82189a5378/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752235214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/086c03d20ea84ca761916907ad6c0f82189a5378/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752235214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old.\r\nThis DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838590/extras/f018d0